---
import '../styles/global.css';
import {canonicalUrl,callUrl,shop} from '../data/shop';
---
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><link rel="canonical" href={canonicalUrl('/privacy/')}/><meta name="description" content="How Moin Mutton Mart handles your browser draft and WhatsApp request."/><title>Privacy · Moin Mutton Mart</title></head><body><main class="simple-page"><a href="/">← Back to the counter</a><h1>Your request, your choice.</h1><p>Your browser stores selected product IDs and quantities to restore your draft for 24 hours from the first item. Editing does not extend this period. Expired drafts are discarded when you return; stored data may remain while the site is closed. Prices, contact details and addresses are not saved in the draft. Notes stay in memory and are cleared on reload. Removing all items clears the saved list. There are no customer accounts or payments.</p><p>Continuing on WhatsApp opens a message you can review and send yourself. WhatsApp processes information under its own privacy terms. The shop receives it only if you send it.</p><p>Only include information needed for your request. Discuss your address directly with the shop if delivery is available.</p><p>If you need help using the catalogue or requesting an accessible alternative, call <a href={callUrl}>{shop.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p></main></body></html>
